# Inside a coop (barn.c). Six nest boxes along the back wall, one per hen: an egg shows in a hen's box
# when she has laid. Hens peck around the floor; the trough is filled from the straw-and-feed store.
# The bale by the roost is that store (A fills the trough). Walls and floor follow the farm's building
# style. The doorway leads back out to the coop door.
map COOP set=INTERIOR w=10 h=9 music=NONE
key L WALL_SIDE_L block
key R WALL_SIDE_R block
key T BARN_BEAM block
key l BARN_BEAM_LAMP block
key W BARN_WALL_CLASSIC block
key . BARN_FLOOR_CLASSIC walk
key N NEST_EMPTY block
key P PERCH block
key B BARN_BALE block

key X WALL_FRONT block
key C WALL_CORNER_L block
key D WALL_CORNER_R block
key [ BARN_DOOR_L walk
key ] BARN_DOOR_R walk
grid
LTTlTTlTTR
LWWWWWWWWR
LNNNNNNPBR
L........R
L........R
L........R
L........R
L........R
CXXX[]XXXD
place FEED_TROUGH 6 5
warp 4 8 FARM 0 0 down
warp 5 8 FARM 0 0 down
